{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02392","headline":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 十五 · 韦渠牟","name":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西海辞金母，东方拜木公。\n云行疑带雨，星步欲凌风。\n羽袖挥丹凤，霞巾曳彩虹。\n飘颻九霄外，下视望仙宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦渠牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}